---
import HandArrow from '../components/HandArrow.astro';
import Row from '../components/Row.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Gokul Ramanan"
  description="I build real-time systems for internal sales teams and external clients."
>
  <section class="section">
    <Row>
      <p class="eyebrow">Software engineer at JPMorgan Chase · Mumbai</p>
      <h1>I build <mark>real-time systems</mark> for internal sales teams and external clients.</h1>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        Mostly backend work, in Java and Spring Boot.
        <HandArrow />
      </Fragment>
    </Row>
    <Row>
      <p class="intro">
        I'm a backend engineer. I work on live data streaming and alerting, with a focus on low latency and high
        availability: apps that respond fast and keep running when something fails. I use AI coding tools to assist
        with my daily workflows.
      </p>
      <div class="paths">
        <a href="/resume" class="path"><small>Hiring?</small><span>Here's my résumé →</span></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="path"><small>Want to talk?</small><span>Say hello →</span></a>
      </div>
      <Fragment slot="note">Weekdays: code.<br />Weekends: football.<br />Most evenings: the gym.</Fragment>
    </Row>
  </section>
</Page>
